{
  "file": "module6",
  "page": 41,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        71.16439056396484,
        331.1677551269531,
        88.12939453125
      ],
      "text": "2.4.1.2\t Summary of evidence and rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.20639038085938,
        403.3960266113281,
        115.62739562988281
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 15: TPT for adults and adolescents living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.4215698242188,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation of TPT for all people living with HIV was first published by WHO in 2011  .  (33)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.4310302734375,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review of 12 RCTs, which included 8578 people living with HIV, found that preventive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        527.4266967773438,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "treatment reduced the overall risk for TB by 33% (relative risk (RR) 0.67; 95% CI: 0.51–0.87)  . For  (49)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        527.3990478515625,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "those who were TST positive, the reduction increased to 64% (RR 0.36; 95% CI: 0.22–0.61). Although",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.4190063476562,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "not statistically significant, the reduction was 14% among TST-negative people (RR 0.86; 95% CI:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.4157104492188,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "0.59–1.26) and those of unknown TST status (RR 0.86; 95% CI: 0.48–1.52). Most of the studies in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.4397583007812,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "the review were, however, conducted before ART became available, and there is now increasing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        527.4179077148438,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "evidence from observational studies and RCTs of the efficacy of TPT in people receiving ART. TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.3824005126953,
        527.4300537109375,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "incidence has been reported to be high among people living with HIV who did not receive IPT,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.4136962890625,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "including those with CD4 > 350 cells/mm  and who were TST negative  . One double-blind RCT  (50) 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.4234008789062,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "of 1329 people living with HIV receiving ART indicated that those on ART with negative TST or IGRA",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        527.42529296875,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "benefited more from IPT than those who were TST or IGRA positive  . An RCT of 2056 people  (45)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        527.42138671875,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV showed additive benefits of TPT plus ART in reducing both TB incidence and overall",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        380.5868225097656,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "mortality  . The protective effect lasted for more than 5 years. (47, 51)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.3880004882812,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The GDG reviewed the evidence from the systematic reviews and discussed each population risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.3978271484375,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "group identified in detail for the prevalence of TB infection, risk of progression to TB disease and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.3682861328125,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "the incidence of TB disease as compared with the general population. They concluded that the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.41552734375,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "evidence shows a clear benefit of systematic testing and treatment of TB infection for people living",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.412353515625,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "with HIV. The wording of the recommendation now refers to TB infection testing rather than TST given",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.4539794921875,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "that IGRA is also an option (see Recommendation 18), in addition to the recently recommended",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.3880004882812,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "antigen-based skin tests (TBST) (see Recommendation 19). Preventive treatment  M. tuberculosis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.3933715820312,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "should be given to adults and adolescents living with HIV, regardless of their immune status and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.45068359375,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "whether they are on ART, given the evidence of additional protective effect when provided with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.4143676757812,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "ART. A systematic review of studies conducted before ART became available showed the value of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.4451293945312,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "providing preventive treatment immediately after successful completion of TB treatment among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.4215698242188,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "people living with HIV in countries with a TB incidence > 100 per 100 000 population  .  (33, 47)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.3923950195312,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Therefore, preventive treatment is recommended for people who were previously treated for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.409912109375,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "and for whom a new exposure to TB is confirmed. No evidence was found, however, for preventive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.4552001953125,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "treatment of people who had successfully completed treatment for MDR-TB or XDR-TB. The effect",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.427490234375,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "of repeated courses of preventive treatment is unclear and hence no recommendation on this is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.4121704101562,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "made in the present guidelines. One recent RCT showed that in settings with high TB transmission,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.4000244140625,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "a second round of preventive therapy did not provide additional benefit to persons receiving",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.3865966796875,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "ART  . In settings with high TB transmission, however, daily IPT for 36 months or longer is  (52)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4262084960938,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "recommended conditionally   (see Recommendation 21). The relative risk of TB transmission is  (53)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.4287109375,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "determined by the local authorities on the basis of risk of exposure (e.g. TB incidence, occurrence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.3781127929688,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "of undiagnosed or inadequately treated disease, population density, environmental factors) and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        200.10350036621094,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "host immune response  . (13)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.3860473632812,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Pregnant women living with HIV are at risk for TB, which can have severe consequences for both",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.4168090820312,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "the mother and the fetus, with increased risk of maternal and infant death  . Pregnancy should  (54)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.3823852539062,
        527.4419555664062,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "not disqualify women living with HIV from receiving preventive treatment with medicines commonly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.3823852539062,
        527.4168701171875,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "used to treat TB disease that are generally considered safe for use in pregnancy, such as isoniazid and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.3823852539062,
        527.4124755859375,
        731.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin (classified as Pregnancy Category C by the United States Food and Drug Administration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.3823852539062,
        137.44430541992188,
        745.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "(FDA))  . (55, 56)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        329.7992858886719,
        801.2599487304688,
        553.4072875976562,
        811.8897705078125
      ],
      "text": "23 2. ﻿ Reduce the burden of TB among people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}